    "The Nucleotide database is a collection of sequences from several sources, including GenBank, RefSeq, TPA and PDB. Genome, gene and transcript sequence data provide the foundation for biomedical research and discovery.": "Nucleotide 数据库汇集了来自 GenBank、RefSeq、TPA 与 PDB 等多个来源的序列。基因组、基因与转录本序列数据是生物医学研究与发现的基础。",
    "The Protein database is a collection of sequences from several sources, including translations from annotated coding regions in GenBank, RefSeq and TPA, as well as records from SwissProt, PIR, PRF, and PDB. Protein sequences are the fundamental determinants of biological structure and function.": "Protein 数据库汇集了来自多个来源的序列，包括 GenBank、RefSeq 与 TPA 中已注释编码区的翻译产物，以及来自 SwissProt、PIR、PRF 与 PDB 的记录。蛋白质序列是生物结构与功能的根本决定因素。",
